- Kalisch, M., et al. (2012). Causal Inference Using Graphical Models with the R Package pcalg. *Journal of Statistical Software*, 47(11), 1–26. <https://doi.org/10.18637/jss.v047.i11>
- Scheidegger, C., Hörrmann, J., & Bühlmann, P. (2022). The Weighted Generalised Covariance Measure. *Journal of Machine Learning Research*, 23(273), 1–68. <https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v23/21-1328.html>
- Software documentation: [pcalg](https://cran.r-universe.dev/pcalg/doc/manual.html) and [weightedGCM](https://cyrillsch.r-universe.dev/weightedGCM/doc/manual.html).
- Starting scripts: `weightedGCM_test_colin.R`, `weightedGCMtest_allie.R`, and `pc_automated_colin.R`, from summer work by Colin Dempsey and Allison Burnett. All six supplied summer scripts are preserved unchanged under `reference_scripts/` for provenance and are not run by this report.



